+named allow-list, and a probe guard for a setting's path; all three are tripwires, not proofs), the Retry-After rule
+tested on real HTTP 429 replies at every reader, key files that are links, and the wording pins.
+Made-up data only; loopback only; fake keys are built from parts."""
